/scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974535_169047908250742_8418151156766296047_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dpsWc4gID3IQ7kNvwE3sJrL&_nc_oc=AdqmKGnKS3PWmF_kn57uiqQdiPFwmIFNpWtgY-VJI04ijxRrrM8eJCj5Ywm1m21aGeU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRPtay4MAfmx5LrneYeuLnXeHi4HTaTuZDHf-r2hzQyDQ&oe=6B0C68F8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Image_Cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "418797219253351", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974555_418797222586684_516936567010903441_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8OrF9-Rp1xMQ7kNvwHdMIUb&_nc_oc=AdrdKwN4VEWEDWfbnTSRMaqvbSNvOrlNCgZMpiPXrFwnZjGkzzWoeFL8wm2EOLm3Y8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTO9ZZvM_g4AXJdWccv-3ayq619G1AH-ie8VG6M92e6ng&oe=6B0C7080"}, "display_name": "DoVille Adventures", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DoVille Adventures has launched! Designed by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, it's your vacation dream come true! Episode One, Juniper Beach, is a low poly BEACH adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use summer activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun. Take a dip, water ski, or ride the hot-air balloon. For more information (and even a report on the positive brain effects, visit doville dot fun). ", "short_description": "DoVille Adventures has launched! Here's one you can hand to Granny with your (old) Oculus Go. Designed by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, it's your vacation dream come true! Episode One, Juniper Beach, is a low poly BEACH adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun."}]}, "developer_name": "Project Whitecard Digital Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url":